{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "def fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\n    Uses recursion with memoization for O(n) time and space complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {1: 1, 2: 1} # Initialize memo with base cases F(1)=1, F(2)=1\n\n    def _fib_recursive(k):\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n        \n        result = _fib_recursive(k - 1) + _fib_recursive(k - 2)\n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    return _fib_recursive(n)"}
